{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822500/extras/a562cf61efcf14ef9b718095d176cd61.avif?t=1752089181\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dylan has lost everything and now he wants to forget everything, help him on his short journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEVELOPMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One/Iro is a 3D first-person puzzle game, it was made for Cinegame-jam and now it has been revisited and is available for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AN ADVENTURE IN THE HUMAN SOUL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow Dylan on his journey through dreams and discover what happened to him and his family. Find his memories and the pieces to complete the dream machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORATION </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the levels to discover all the endings! The game features several levels to explore, to move from and from one level to another, completing the puzzles to progress. Search the rooms for the objects needed to continue.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822500?t=1752089181","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822500?t=1752089181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822500/c1d6e3ad0bc4ab4476ef40b36a59be470e717f4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752089181","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822500/c1d6e3ad0bc4ab4476ef40b36a59be470e717f4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752089181","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mention of alcohol use"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822500/extras/a562cf61efcf14ef9b718095d176cd61.avif?t=1752089181\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dylan has lost everything and now he wants to forget everything, help him on his short journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEVELOPMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One/Iro is a 3D first-person puzzle game, it was made for Cinegame-jam and now it has been revisited and is available for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AN ADVENTURE IN THE HUMAN SOUL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Follow Dylan on his journey through dreams and discover what happened to him and his family. Find his memories and the pieces to complete the dream machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORATION </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the levels to discover all the endings! The game features several levels to explore, to move from and from one level to another, completing the puzzles to progress. Search the rooms for the objects needed to continue.</p>","developers":["Altrea Stories"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822500/5d7685f3f00ef3e621aea4684dd1b55dff91e1cd/header.jpg?t=1752089181","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64bit Linux Debian based distros<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo E6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GT620 1GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space<